OL,3,GNEWSACommunity buys pub and plans
OL,4,ASussex-only beer sales
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chairman of a community group which
OL,7,Fbought a pub to save it from closure
OL,8,Fsays they want it to be "a place where
OL,9,Fpeople are always welcome" - and plan
OL,10,Fto only sell Sussex-brewed beer.
OL,12,FResidents in Amberley raised #750,000
OL,13,Fto buy The Sportsman in Rackham Road,
OL,14,Fafter its former owner put the building
OL,15,Fup for sale.
OL,17,FThe pub will now be run by community
OL,18,Fmembers, and plans to sell exclusively
OL,19,Flocal beers from October onwards.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
