OL,3,GNEWSACommunity buys pub and plans
OL,4,ASussex-only beer sales
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoger Agate, chairman of Community
OL,7,FSportsman Amberley, told BBC Radio
OL,8,FSussex: "I want this to be a pub like I
OL,9,Fremember when I started drinking in the
OL,10,F1970s and 1980s."
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
